# Form field layout

## Do

- Put **required** fields first
- Put optional or rarely changed fields behind an **Advanced options** disclosure
- Add concise help text so users understand each control
- Prefer shared `Field` / `src/components/ui` primitives over one-off layout patterns

## Don't

- Interleave optional/advanced controls above required fields
- Dump every setting in one flat list without grouping
